{"kind": "mod", "id": 620, "name": "Props In-Raid Modding (PIRM)", "slug": "props-in-raid-modding-pirm", "teaser": "Want the weapon frame but not the other crap?  Now you can.  Also highly compatible with other mods as a client mod.", "owner_name": "Props", "downloads": 24866, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/850.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:40.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-10-19T23:15:32.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-10-19T23:15:32.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "2.0.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>I don’t like using Server Value Modifier since it sometimes causes conflicts with other mods. I prefer to have an individual mod for a feature i need so i’m sharing this with all of you in case you are the same. (i would have used fin’s mod if it wasn’t out of date)</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1. Unzip this into your SPT-AKI/Bepinex/Plugins folder</p>\n<p>If you guys enjoy my work and feel like buying me caffeine, here’s my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/T6T7QSN01\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kofi.</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.7.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1627, "published_at": "2023-10-21T17:04:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/620/props-in-raid-modding-pirm/1.7.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.7.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.4", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1469, "published_at": "2023-12-12T15:50:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/620/props-in-raid-modding-pirm/1.7.2", "github_url": null, "external_u